OL,3,AInvestors sue chip giant Intel after
OL,4,A29% stock plunge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIntel shares plunged on 30 October,
OL,7,Ferasing tens of billions of dollars off
OL,8,Fits market value the day after it
OL,9,Fforecasted disappointing revenue in its
OL,10,Fcoming earnings report.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted Intel for
OL,13,Fcomment.
